graph TB
  subgraph Navegador [Cliente Web / Browser]
    UI[React 18 + Vite]
    Editor[Editor CAD Konva.js]
    Zustand[Store Zustand + History]
    HeatmapViewer[Visor Canvas 2D / WebGL]
    WorkerPool[Pool Web Workers Comlink]
    
    UI --> Editor
    UI --> Zustand
    Editor --> Zustand
    Zustand --> HeatmapViewer
    Zustand --> WorkerPool
    WorkerPool --> HeatmapViewer
  end

  subgraph Servidor [Backend NestJS]
    API[REST API / OpenAPI]
    Auth[Auth JWT]
    Queue[BullMQ Processor]
    
    API --> Auth
    API --> Queue
  end

  subgraph Almacenamiento [Persistencia & Cache]
    DB[(PostgreSQL 16)]
    Redis[(Redis)]
    S3[(MinIO / S3 Storage)]
  end

  UI -->|HTTP / JSON| API
  API --> DB
  Queue --> Redis
  Queue --> S3
  WorkerPool -.->|Cálculo aislado| PhysicsCore["physics-core (TS puro)"]
  Queue -.->|Jobs en batch| PhysicsCore
